  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "最高に強化されたフェザーボール。速くまっすぐに飛ぶ。空を飛んでいるポケモンなどに使う。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "최고로 강화된 페더볼. 빠르게 똑바로 날아간다. 재빠른 포켓몬이나 하늘 높이 나는 포켓몬을 잡을 때 유용하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "強化到最高階的飛羽球。能直線高速飛行，在捕捉動作快速的寶可夢及飛在高空的寶可夢時十分有效。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cette version ultime de la Plume Ball fend les airs à toute vitesse, en ligne droite. Elle permet notamment d’attraper les Pokémon qui volent ou qui sont très rapides.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Die ultimative Version des Federballs. Dieser Ball fliegt schnell und gerade. Er eignet sich besonders zum Fangen flinker oder fliegender Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Versión inmejorable de la Pluma Ball que vuela muy rápido y en línea recta al lanzarla. Ideal para capturar Pokémon ágiles o Pokémon voladores.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Versione potenziata al massimo della Piuma Ball che vola rapida in linea retta. È efficace per catturare Pokémon veloci e Pokémon che volano alti nel cielo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ultimate iteration of the Feather Ball. A ball that flies fast and true—ideal for catching nimble Pokémon or Pokémon that fly high in the air.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "最高に強化されたフェザーボール。速くまっすぐに飛ぶ。素早いポケモンや空高く飛ぶポケモンの捕獲に有効である。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "强化到最高阶的飞羽球。能直线高速飞行，在捕捉动作快速的宝可梦及飞在高空的宝可梦时十分有效。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
